the knowledge base r3_7_credit_approval includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/credit-approval.ruml".

Approve credit holds for a case if
    Income verification holds for the case
    and No negative indicators holds for the case.

Income verification holds for a case if
    High income holds for the case.

Income verification holds for a case if
    Medium income collateral holds for the case.

the conditions of No negative indicators are met for a case if
    Insolvency present holds for the case
    and Negative schufa entry holds for the case.

No negative indicators holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the conditions of No negative indicators are met for the case.

High income holds for a case if
    the answer to High income for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
High income holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to High income for the case is a truth value
    and High income would hold for the case.

Medium income collateral holds for a case if
    Medium income holds for the case
    and Collateral available holds for the case.

Insolvency present holds for a case if
    the answer to Insolvency present for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Insolvency present holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Insolvency present for the case is a truth value
    and Insolvency present would hold for the case.

Negative schufa entry holds for a case if
    the answer to Negative schufa entry for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Negative schufa entry holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Negative schufa entry for the case is a truth value
    and Negative schufa entry would hold for the case.

Medium income holds for a case if
    the answer to Medium income for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Medium income holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Medium income for the case is a truth value
    and Medium income would hold for the case.

Collateral available holds for a case if
    the answer to Collateral available for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Collateral available holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Collateral available for the case is a truth value
    and Collateral available would hold for the case.

